# Gate runs: obj_<label>/ is 5,528 decks and <label>.tsv is their hashes.
# Reproducible from tools/gate.sh in ten minutes, and 30 MB each.  A single
# `git add -A` from the repo root put 11,565 of them into one commit on
# 2026-09-10 and took .git from 92 MB to 131 MB.
obj_*/
/g[0-9]*.tsv
/r[0-9]*.tsv
/modules.txt
work/measurements/dlib-bytes/
